			],
			"Message": "docs(Rest): Rewrite README description and update badge labels\n\nRefresh the Rest README to reflect its current role as the compilation server for Land, replacing the outdated \"HTTP/REST API server\" language with a clear explanation of how the editor sends compilation, bundling, and language-service requests to Rest. Clarify the dual OXC/SWC backend architecture and the Fn/Struct module organization.\n\nAlso normalize badge labels — change \"Last-commit\" to \"Update\", \"Issues\" to \"Issue\", and \"Downloads\" to \"Download\" for consistency, and fix the download badge URL to include `/total`.\n\nThese changes help new contributors quickly understand Rest's place in the Land editor architecture without reading the source.",
